<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 79 0 R
/E (Indian college students struggle to use ChatGPT voice input regularly for study and career-related tasks, especially when they are around other people or need to word a prompt carefully. They prefer typing because it offers more privacy and makes mistakes easier to correct. As a result, voice input remains an occasional option rather than their usual way of entering prompts.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
